{"id":"498227","name":"西红柿羊肉汤","author":"柳絮1982","authorId":"563830","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/498227/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"适量"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄沙司","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊肉切块洗干净。","img":"images/498227/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入锅中焯水。","img":"images/498227/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"西红柿洗干净。","img":"images/498227/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"破壁机中打碎。","img":"images/498227/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"金针菇焯水。","img":"images/498227/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备好的材料。","img":"images/498227/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中加油加入姜丝。","img":"images/498227/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入葱花翻炒。","img":"images/498227/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入西红柿汁。","img":"images/498227/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"在加入番茄沙司。","img":"images/498227/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烧开。","img":"images/498227/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入羊肉炖煮。","img":"images/498227/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"汁变得浓稠。","img":"images/498227/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入金针菇","img":"images/498227/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入耗油。","img":"images/498227/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"撒葱花。","img":"images/498227/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"装碗，酸酸甜甜很下饭。","img":"images/498227/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}